            "mode": "self_check",
            "prompt": "Kis gaseous equilibrium par pressure ka koi asar nahi: 2NO₂ ⇌ N₂O₄; PCl₅ ⇌ PCl₃ + Cl₂; CO + H₂O ⇌ CO₂ + H₂; 2SO₂ + O₂ ⇌ 2SO₃?",
            "explanation": "CO + H₂O ⇌ CO₂ + H₂, kyun ke dono taraf gas ke 2 moles hain; pressure ya volume badalne ka asar dono taraf barabar hai. Baqi teeno mein gas moles badalte hain, is liye woh pressure se shift hoti hain."
